# Shared documents are private: keep them out of search engines, and don't
# leak their address to sites they link to.
#
# The CSP blocks inline and injected scripts, javascript: URLs and plugins on
# share pages, where the document comes from whoever made the link. The
# sha256 source is the theme script inline in index.html: editing that script
# changes its hash, so update it here too (tests/share/headers.test.ts checks).
# 'wasm-unsafe-eval' lets Shiki compile its WebAssembly highlighter; it doesn't
# allow eval() of JavaScript.
/s/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Content-Security-Policy: script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com 'sha256-XLWye/yrVo9ar/JAHLq5YEHcxo5ypNkAfDVfVSzdoPA='; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'
